license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ioanungurean32/zt-iiot-testbed"
url: "https://usv.ro/en/"
abstract: "A Docker-based multi-protocol testbed for evaluating a Zero Trust IIoT prototype over Modbus/TCP, MQTT, and OPC UA, with matched baselines that isolate the security-processing overhead, asymmetric (ES256) trust tokens, concurrency/saturation measurements, and a PDP-outage fail-safe lifecycle. Version 2.1.0 adds a transparent native-wire protocol-aware Modbus/TCP PEP that parses function codes from the wire and enforces policy on unmodified clients, with a demonstrated non-bypassability check."
